      C   13   water   protons   .   .   .   .   ppm   0.0        internal   indirect   0.251449530   .   .   .   .   .   6577   1
      H   1    water   protons   .   .   .   .   ppm   4.657657   internal   direct     1.0           .   .   .   .   .   6577   1
